# headwear/cloth/veil: the Veil (OUTER, P2b wave 2): a fine cloth over the hair, set back to show the hairline, falling straight
# beside the face over the shoulders and in long folds down the back to the shoulder blades (a lit hem); no cowl, so it
# reads apart from the hood. Hair mask: 18 px over the head.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
